  "goodToKnow": "Das Wirtschaftswachstum is economic growth, measured by GDP (BIP): ein schwaches, starkes Wirtschaftswachstum. After the post-war Wirtschaftswunder, Germany's growth slowed; in 2023 and 2024 the economy shrank slightly, and debates focused on energy prices, bureaucracy and the car industry. Das Wachstum means growth, and wachsen to grow. Ankurbeln means to boost. It has no plural."
